# AGENTS.md is canon; scripts/agent-sync.mjs hashes its raw bytes and
# compares against a hash stamped into every per-tool config pointer
# (.claude/settings.json, .cursor/settings.json, .codex/config.yaml,
# .github/copilot-instructions.md, .agents/task-contracts.json). Without
# a forced line ending, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true
# converts LF -> CRLF on checkout, silently changing the byte content and
# therefore the hash, so the sync gate fails identically for every agent
# on every clean Windows clone regardless of what they touched.
AGENTS.md text eol=lf
